        "## What Website Maintenance Actually Includes",
        "Website maintenance covers a broad range of activities: security patches and software updates, performance monitoring and optimization, content updates and additions, broken link checks, backup management, SSL certificate renewals, analytics review, uptime monitoring, and compatibility testing with new browser versions and devices. It's not glamorous work, but it's the difference between a website that generates leads and one that silently deteriorates.",
